{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183500/extras/a578cde451f8f35c932bfcd0f11ed8bc.poster.avif?t=1592410786\" width=620 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183500/extras/a578cde451f8f35c932bfcd0f11ed8bc.webm?t=1592410786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183500/extras/a578cde451f8f35c932bfcd0f11ed8bc.mp4?t=1592410786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Puppy Cross is a nonogram (picross) and care game, revolving around cute dogs! Solve more than a hundred puzzles to unlock content for your garden: Toys, Dogs, Decorative items. Customize your little space and give it personality!<br><br>By unlocking the &quot;Dalmatian&quot; mode you will be able to play endlessly on randomized grids. Send your favourite grids' seeds to your friends and race for the best time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183500/extras/bceed704e8642023d8a456090f9d26c5.poster.avif?t=1592410786\" width=620 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183500/extras/bceed704e8642023d8a456090f9d26c5.webm?t=1592410786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183500/extras/bceed704e8642023d8a456090f9d26c5.mp4?t=1592410786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 100 hand-drawn grids<br></li><li>Many many more in randomizer mode<br></li><li>Grid sizes from 5x5 to 20x20<br></li><li>A seed system to race your friends<br></li><li>4 garden areas to decorate<br></li><li>50 different dog breeds<br></li><li>Petting!!!!<br></li><li>Cute graphics<br></li><li>Groovy soundtrack by Monplaisir<br></li><li>Beginner friendly</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME SETTINGS</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Previous and Next buttons<br></li><li>2 options to grey out hints (Progressive or Ordered)<br></li><li>Grids can be saved for later<br></li><li>Autofill<br></li><li>2 selection modes (Linear or Free Drawing)<br></li><li>Multi-selection indicator</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183500/extras/484db90bd2c1fd8755e6e4c3d4a5834b.poster.avif?t=1592410786\" width=620 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183500/extras/484db90bd2c1fd8755e6e4c3d4a5834b.webm?t=1592410786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183500/extras/484db90bd2c1fd8755e6e4c3d4a5834b.mp4?t=1592410786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Hours of fun and cuteness await you!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"5afb01ee6e6d2e096877b817299862fb8c6d40a2.jpg","localized_name":"A Good Boys' World","name":"A Good Boys' World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1183500/5afb01ee6e6d2e096877b817299862fb8c6d40a2.jpg"},{"icon":"ac8c8b8b1407046666e2543d75c7d3a90f5b9559.jpg","localized_name":"What's Up Dog?","name":"What's Up Dog?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1183500/ac8c8b8b1407046666e2543d75c7d3a90f5b9559.jpg"},{"icon":"743f43a4835df2fb4ccbd7824b8de752194479b7.jpg","localized_name":"Pug Life","name":"Pug Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1183500/743f43a4835df2fb4ccbd7824b8de752194479b7.jpg"},{"icon":"fe22bd75d650aa31b5f0b99cd33487a5a7218901.jpg","localized_name":"Hot Dog","name":"Hot Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s